Below is a complete beginner-friendly procedure you can follow on an Ubuntu VM/EC2 instance.
Harbor can be deployed with Docker Compose. Current Harbor documentation lists Docker Engine >20.10, Docker Compose >2.3, minimum 2 CPU/4 GB RAM/40 GB disk, with 4 CPU/8 GB recommended. �
